<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-117-8.1-036> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Adopt the following TP for 38.214 clause 5.1 in principle as alignment CR
--------Start of TP--------
A UE that indicates supportOfERedCap-r18 capability but does not indicate eRedCapNotReducedBB-BWFG 48-2, during a process of P-RNTI triggered SI acquisition, when the total number of PRBs for the PDSCH scheduled with SI-RNTI and the PDSCH scheduled with C-RNTI, MCS-C-RNTI, or CS-RNTI scheduled in the slot is larger than 25 PRBs if configured with SCS µ = 0 or larger than 12 PRBs if configured with SCS µ = 1, the UE may skip decoding of the scheduled PDSCH with C-RNTI, MCS-C-RNTI, or CS-RNTI.
--------End of TP--------

To 38.214 editor: Endorsed 38.214 draftCR (R1-2403810) from RAN1#116bis has included the revision of parameter supportOfRedCap-r18 to supportOfERedCap-r18, then above change of parameter supportOfERedCap-r18 is just an editorial change.
Above agreement is recommended to be incorporated into NR R18 alignment CR for TS 38.214, please consider it in the next specification revision.


Final summary in R1-2405462.
For information: R1-2405463RAN1 agreements for Rel-18 NR eRedCapRapporteur (Ericsson)



