<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-118-7-018> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Draft CR for Rel-17 RedCap R1-2406401 is endorsed in principle with the following revision: 
Summary of change:For RedCap UE, clarify that the UE determines PDCCH monitoring occasions for CORESET#0 if all the following conditions are met:the CORESET#0 is contained in the non-initial active DL BWP the non-initial DL BWP has the same SCS and CP as initialDownlinkBWP or CORESET#0, and separate initial DL BWP if configured. The following RAN1 conclusion applies to this CR:Conclusion There is no intent to introduce Rel-17 Redcap UE capability to support the configuration with a separate Initial DL BWP with different SCS and CP compared to legacy initial DL BWP.Rel-17 RedCap UE is not expected to be configured with a separate Initial DL BWP with different SCS and CP compared to legacy initial DL BWP.Consequences if not approved:Determination of PDCCH monitoring occasions for RedCap UEs is unclear.
""" .
