<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-118-8.2.1-003> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Introduce following FG that indicates support of BWP switch by DCI format 0_3/1_3.
FG name
Support of BWP switch indication by DCI format 0_3/1_3
Component
