<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-118-9.10.1-001> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
For solutions based on triggering/enabling by network signaling to enable Tx/Rx in gaps/restrictions that are caused by RRM measurements select one among the following options:
Option 1: Support Alt. 1-1:
