Value of X is larger than 1. FFS on additional details of X.
""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-118-9.6.1-002> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Confirm the Working Assumption that OOK-4 with M=4 for 15KHz SCS is supported for LP-WUS.
AgreementFor OOK-4 with M >1, support M=2 & M=4 (working assumption) for LP-WUS. M=4 for 15KHz SCSM=4 for 30KHz SCS (working assumption)FFS M=1 for OOK-4


R1-2407356Summary #2 of discussions on LP-WUS and LP-SS designModerator (vivo)
From Wednesday session""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-118-9.6.1-003> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Regarding the LP-WUS information to trigger PDCCH monitoring of RRC connected UEs (for non-CA case), select at least one from the following 
Option 1: A bitmap with each bit corresponding to [one or more] UEs
