<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-118-9.8.2-006> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
For near-field channel, the following formula is adopted to model the phase of direct path between TRP and UE as antenna element-wise channel parameter:
exp⁡(-j2πd3Dλ0)exp-j2π|ru,s|-d3Dλ0,
where the ru,s refers to the vector determined by the location of antenna element u and s. The d3D refers to the 3D distance between reference antenna at TRP and UE side.
""" .
