-resourceAllocation = resourceAllocationType1 and not all bits of a block of the frequency domain resource assignment field associated with the activated SCell in the DCI format 0_3/1_3 are equal to 1, or
-resourceAllocation = dynamicSwitch and not all bits of a block of the frequency domain resource assignment field associated with the activated SCell in the DCI format 0_3/1_3 are equal to either 0 or 1, or
