<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-118b-8.2-012> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement:
Send a reply LS to RAN2 to inform the following RAN1’s understanding.
FG45-3a/4a, 45-5/5a/6 do not need to be indicated separately for intra and inter-frequency LTM cell switch.
If UE supports ltm-InterFreq-r18, the support of above FGs implies the support for inter-frequency scenarios in addition to intra-frequency scenarios. If UE only supports ltm-MCG-IntraFreq-r18 or ltm-SCG-IntraFreq-r18, the support of above FGs implies the support for intra-frequency scenarios.
Same understanding is applicable to FG45-3/4 as well.
Reply LS to RAN2 LS in R1-2407603/R2-2407601 is incorporated into R1-2409045.""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-118b-9.1.1-001> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Answer to Q2 in R1-2407604 as below:
