""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-118b-9.1.1-002> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
For BM-Case1 and BM-Case2 with a UE-sided AI/ML model, for Option 2 (UE-assisted performance monitoring), 
