FFS on activation (including when/how) of inference report after obtaining the applicability from UE Step 4
FFS: whether Step 5 is needed,

Option 2: 
In Step 3, following configurations are provided from NW to UE:
UE is allowed to do UAI reporting via OtherConfig, 
NW configures one set or multiple sets of inference related parameters
Note: the set of inference related parameters is not configured by CSI-ReportConfig 
