Set A related information
Set B related information
Report content related information 
For BM-Case 2, 
Time instances related information for measurements
Time instances related information for prediction
Note: not applicable may also be replied by UE
Note: if the inference related parameters are not supported for reporting, only the applicability(ies) or not is reported in Step 4. 
the associated ID(s) may be included
