<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-118b-9.4.1.1-005> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Update [2K1] in link budget table as follows,
[2K1]Remaining CW interference (dBm)N/ACalculated (see Note 1)Note: only applicable for device 1/2a
