Supported by: Qualcomm, Spreadtrum, vivo, OPPO, MediaTek, ZTE, Apple
Strong concerns: Samsung, CATT

Proposal 2.1.5.3b-v2:
For explicit indication by DCI, bit value equal to “0” means UE behaviour for the corresponding gap/restriction occasion is as per legacy behaviour.
Supported by: Samsung, LGE, Huawei, InterDigital, CATT, Meta
