<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-120-9.7.2-012> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
When absolute delay model Δτ is configured, it applies to all NLOS clusters in each of Tx-target and target-Rx links and background channel. 
