<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-120-9.8.1-012> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Adopt the following absolute delay parameters for InH scenarios.
Down-select between option 1, 2 and 3.
