Option A for MO configuration is supported.
""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-120b-9.6.2-003> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
A LP-WUS MO can span across multiple slots. 
FFS the limitation on the maximum length for an LP-WUS MO
""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-120b-9.6.2-004> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Only R = 1 is supported for Option A.
