ptional) Z = 4, 8 mMetricCDF of the ratio between the 2nd, 3rd ,4th, ..., xth (smallest) PRB singular value and the 1st PRB (largest) singular value (serving cell) at t=0 plotted in 10*log10 scale. Note-1: The PRB singular values of a PRB are the eigenvalues of the mean covariance matrix in the PRB.Note-2: The value of x is the minimum value of (number of BS antenna ports, number of UT antenna ports)

