R1-2503076[Draft] Reply LS on number of beam measurements in the measurement report MAC CEModerator (Fujitsu)
Wednesday decision: Draft reply LS on number of beam measurements in the measurement report MAC CE is endorsed assuming the following editorials:
RAN1 would like to thank RAN2 for their LS on number of beam measurements in the measurement report MAC CE. 

RAN1 assumes at maximum 16 beams can be reported by a single event triggered reporting regardless whether or not the report includes the current beam. It is noted that the maximum number of beams that can be reported by a UE is subject to UE capability which is under discussion in RAN1.
Final reply LS to R2-2501485 (R1-2501686) is approved in R1-2503077.


