Justification: RAN2 has such agreement
Alt 1-2: At least one candidate RS shall be configured
Spreadtrum, Ericsson, Nokia, DOCOMO, Qualcomm, InterDigital, Samsung, TCL, ZTE, Xiaomi
Justification: RAN1 has similar agreement for UEIBM, and the network most like to configure candidate RSs even for event LTMs.
Comeback on Wednesday.
""" .
