<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-120b-9.9.1-009> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Following restrictions are introduced:
For the codebook configurations in report configuration, typeI-SinglePanel is supported for LTM CSI acquisition.
