The A-CSI report(s) is multiplexed on all PUSCH repetitions within the first OCC group.
""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-121-9.11.3-003> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
