ValueNumber of DMRS CDM group(s) without data DMRS port(s)Number of front-load symbolsOCC sequence for OCC length =2OCC sequence for OCC length =40201[1 1][1 1 1 1]1211[1 -1][1 -1 1 -1]2221[1 1][1 1 -1 -1]3231[1 -1][1 -1 -1 1]4202[1 1][1 1 1 1]5212[1 -1][1 -1 1 -1]6222[1 1][1 1 -1 -1]7232[1 -1][1 -1 -1 1]8242[1 1][1 1 1 1]9252[1 -1][1 -1 1 -1]10262[1 1][1 1 -1 -1]11272[1 -1][1 -1 -1 1]12-15ReservedReservedReservedReservedReserved

