<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-121-9.9.1-002> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
When SpCellInclusion is configured for gNB configured reporting for L1-RSRP based on CSI-RS, the following rule is used to determine the CSI-RS for current SpCell:
