R1-2506460FL summary #3 for Ambient IoT: “10.3.1 Evaluations”Moderator (Huawei)
From Wednesday session""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-122-10.3.1-020> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
For Rel-20 study, add a new item of “Penetration margin (dB)” into link budget template and the value of X dB for evaluation purpose is from the followings:
For both R2D and D2R
X = {0, 20, 80} dB
Note: Example use cases for the values above: 
20 dB for a Device inside a car with metallized car windows
80 dB for a Device inside a metallic shipping container
Companies can report additional example use cases.""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-122-10.3.1-021> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
For Rel-20 study, add a new item of “Receiver interference density (dBm/Hz)” into the link budget template and the value of X dBm/Hz for evaluation purpose is from the followings:
