<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-122-10.3.2-001> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
For R2D, study necessity of addition/removal of M values from Rel-19 M value set for Device 2b and for Device C for at least the following M values:
Addition of M=1
Addition of M=32
Removal of M=24""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-122-10.3.2-002> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Study necessity and feasibility of FEC for R2D for Device 2b and for Device C including the following aspects:
Coding schemes: convolutional code (e.g TBCC), RM code
Note: focus on coding schemes already specified in LTE or NR
FEC code rates: at least 1/2, 1/3
Interleaver or LTE bit collection scheme for TBCC""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-122-10.3.2-003> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Study necessity and feasibility of R2D repetitions for R2D for Device 2b and for Device C considering the following repetition types:
Block-level repetitions
Bit-level Type-2 repetitions
Chip-level repetitions (in case of M=1 with FEC if applied)

