A.5Calculation of scaling factor for changing CDL model angular spread
The following expression for the computing scaling factor, s, to achieve a specific angular spread, AS, in degrees is given by
s=minx≥0{x: ASx=ASdesired}(A-5)
ASx=180π-2lnexpjx∙π180WrapTo180(φLOS)PLOS+n=1Nexpjx∙π180WrapTo180(φn)PnPLOS+n=1NPn(A-6)
where Pn is the power for the nth cluster path, φn is the input cluster path angle (either AOA, AOD, ZOA, ZOD) given in degrees, PLOS is the power for the input LOS path, and φLOS is the input LOS path angle (either AOA, AOD, ZOA, ZOD) given in degrees. If input LOS path does not exist, PLOS=0 is assumed.
