<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-122b-10.5.1-002> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
The following evaluation parameters are agreed for the evaluation on NR ISAC. 
ParametersAssumptions BS antenna configurationFor 4GHz, 4.9GHz:Option 1 as optional Tx: (12,16, 2,1,1;2,16) Rx: (12,16,2,1,1;2,16)Option 2 Tx: (8,8,2,1,1;4,8)Rx: (8,8,2,1,1;4,8)For 6GHz: Option 1 as optional  Tx: (16,16, 2,1,1;4,16) Rx: (16,16,2,1,1;4,16)Option 2: Tx: (8,8,2,1,1;4,8)Rx: (8,8,2,1,1;4,8)Mandatory: dH,dV = (0.5, 0.8)λ, +45°/-45° polarizationOptional: dH,dV = (0.5, 0.5)λ, +45°/-45° polarization
Note: Tx antenna elements and Rx antenna elements are operating simultaneously 
""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-122b-10.5.1-003> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
