<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-123-10.3.2.2-013> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
For D2R interleaving and bit-collection, companies can provide evaluation results with observations on performance gain and required memory according to following form and study the feasibility of supporting additional memory for Rel-20 active device.
LTE subblock interleaving and/or LTE bit collection can provide additional performance gain with increased time diversity gain.
[Source] reports that Alt1 provides performance gain of [A~B] dB over Rel-19 scheme 
[Source] reports that Alt2 provides performance gain of [C~D] dB over Rel-19 scheme.
[Source] reports that Alt3 provides performance gain of [E~F] dB over Rel-19 scheme.
LTE sub-block interleaving and/or LTE bit collection requires additional memory for sub-block interleaving and buffering (i.e., virtual circular buffer)
[Source] reports that Alt1 requires memory size [P~Q] times of max TBS.
[Source] reports that Alt2 requires memory size [R~S] times of max TBS.
[Source] reports that Alt3 requires memory size [T~U] times of max TBS.
Companies report A, B, C, D, E, F, P, Q, R, S, T, U
Companies can use following assumption for their evaluation and report other assumptions.
TBS = 96 bits, 400 bits""" .
<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN1/Resolution/AGR-123-10.3.2.2-014> spectra:sourceRecordWindowText """Agreement
Revise the agreement from #122bis as follows.
AgreementStudy interleaving for PDRCH with FEC, including the necessity and feasibility of the following:Alt 1: reuse both LTE sub-block interleaver and LTE bit collection schemeAlt 2: reuse LTE bit collection scheme without LTE sub-block interleaverAlt 3: based on LTE bit collection scheme with the following update (e.g., for memory reduction) without LTE sub-block interleaver.Each sub-block is divided into one or two segments. For one segment case, it is the same as Alt 2. For two segments case, the bit collection is performed such that 1st segment bits from each sub-block are collected first and then 2nd segment bits from each sub-block are collected.Combination of alternatives can be studied
""" .
